      "about_looks": "Orange-red fur, a white chest and a big bushy tail with a white tip. About as big as a medium-sized dog.",
      "about_food": "Mostly voles and mice. Also hares, birds, eggs, insects and lots of berries in autumn.",
      "about_home": "Sleeps curled up in the open with its tail over its nose. It uses a den only to raise its cubs.",
      "about_winter": "Stays awake all winter. It hears voles moving under the snow and pounces on them nose first.",
      "about_young": "Cubs are born in a den in April or May. Both parents bring them food.",
      "about_fact": "A fox wraps its bushy tail around itself like a warm blanket when it sleeps.",
      "family_mother": "Here's your mom! She knows every path in the forest.",
      "family_father": "And here's your dad. He brings home the food, so stay close!",
      "family_siblings": "These are your brothers and sisters. Expect lots of play-fighting!",
